OL,3,AIranian academic writes of US detention
OL,4,A'hell' over link to 1979 hostage crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Iranian woman detained for months in
OL,7,FTexas has accused the US government of
OL,8,F"bloodline punishment" after it revoked
OL,9,Fher family's green cards over her
OL,10,Fhusband's ties to a prominent figure in
OL,11,FIran.
OL,13,FMaryam Tahmasebi, a professor of
OL,14,Fpsychology and statistics in Los
OL,15,FAngeles, her husband, Seyed Eissa
OL,16,FHashemi, and their teenage son - all
OL,17,Fpermanent residents of the US - were
OL,18,Fdetained by immigration agents in
OL,19,FApril.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
